    "# R54 Phase 3 Full — Colab T4 Runner\n",
    "\n",
    "Trains R54 Phase 3 folds 1-4 on Colab GPU. Bring back per-fold `oof_lists.json` artifacts and run integration locally.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Plan:** fold 1 first as a sanity check, then folds 2-4 if fold 1 looks good. Fold 0 is reused from the local Phase 3 smoke run.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Reference:** `docs/r54_colab_runbook.md`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
